  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>A preview upgrade for the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmarketplace.visualstudio.com%2Fitems%3FitemName%3Dms-azuredevtestlabs.tasks&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cv-madrim%40microsoft.com%7C9e4adcc1c9d747cf660908d731534ab8%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637032106107947275&amp;sdata=uNU5A6vz0jU6DeZpQBfZYGLLEcMRsL5kr6n5dRwb1iU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure DevTest Labs Tasks</a> extension is now available. This extension provides several&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fen-ca%2Fservices%2Fdevops%2Fpipelines%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cv-madrim%40microsoft.com%7C9e4adcc1c9d747cf660908d731534ab8%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637032106107947275&amp;sdata=8B%2BOX22Aab7zxPx1B1hBNkiDyS1VTU4lrEnVvyoIdZA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Pipelines</a>&nbsp;tasks to enable integration with <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fservices%2Fdevtest-lab%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cv-madrim%40microsoft.com%7C9e4adcc1c9d747cf660908d731534ab8%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637032106107957275&amp;sdata=AT4Utb8mencFbjRMW541aYK4KWQHyiVO7uLfbvcqsyA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure DevTest Labs</a>.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The upgrade supports cross-platform agents (Linux, macOS, or Windows)&nbsp;and offers a&nbsp;new task&nbsp;to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmarketplace.visualstudio.com%2Fitems%3FitemName%3Dms-azuredevtestlabs.tasks%23delete-custom-image&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cv-madrim%40microsoft.com%7C9e4adcc1c9d747cf660908d731534ab8%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637032106107967270&amp;sdata=DwjWyGXtZuYJJtkSOswiV9BP%2Fs7XvIIOH7R521UAc64%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">delete&nbsp;custom images</a>&nbsp;automatically, so&nbsp;you&nbsp;no longer&nbsp;need to&nbsp;manually clean up a cluster&nbsp;of images in the lab.&nbsp;The upgrade also supports a parameters file from your DevOps source control in the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmarketplace.visualstudio.com%2Fitems%3FitemName%3Dms-azuredevtestlabs.tasks%23create-vm&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cv-madrim%40microsoft.com%7C9e4adcc1c9d747cf660908d731534ab8%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637032106107967270&amp;sdata=y2XaiHYpQtNwfSuRC1Syf9xQkbrAvmVQZWOkbon9U7U%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Create VM task</a>, allowing you to maintain all the parameters values in&nbsp;source control instead of entering them into&nbsp;the UX.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/azure-devtestlab/blob/master/tasks/Node/RELEASENOTES.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "A preview upgrade for the Azure DevTest Labs Tasks extension is now available. This extension provides several Azure Pipelines tasks to enable integration with Azure DevTest Labs .\n\nThe upgrade supports cross-platform agents (Linux, macOS, or Windows) and offers a new task to delete custom images automatically, so you no longer need to manually clean up a cluster of images in the lab. The upgrade also supports a parameters file from your DevOps source control in the Create VM task , allowing you to maintain all the parameters values in source control instead of entering them into the UX.\n\nLearn more"
  },
